        "content": "<p>Hi all, </p>\n<p>I am looking a theorem states that <code>forall (x : Nat) (xs : Array Nat) (i j : Nat) (hi : i &lt; xs.size) (hj : j &lt; xs.size), x \\in xs  &lt;-&gt; x \\in xs.swap i j hi hj</code>. I could not find anything on <a href=\"https://loogle.lean-lang.org/?q=Array.swap\">https://loogle.lean-lang.org/?q=Array.swap</a></p>",
